{
  "_comment": [
    "Catalogue for the TestCube vs LLMDroid experiment. Edit freely.",
    "'pool': selected = the 30 candidates; reserve = backfill when a candidate fails preflight.",
    "'instrumentation_status' is EVIDENCE, not a prediction. Only 'verified_ok' entries have",
    "actually been instrumented here. scripts/run_experiment.py updates this field as it goes.",
    "Place each binary at apks/<stem>.apk before running.",
    "'coverage_tag' is a starting guess only. run_experiment.py reads the real tag out of the instrumented APK and overrides this, because listening on the wrong tag yields a clean run reporting 0.00000% coverage with no error.",
    "'pin_version_code' forces a specific F-Droid build. Set it whenever 'latest' would fetch a version that does not instrument, as with newpipe 0.29.1."
